OL,3,AICE agent shoots man in New York City
OL,4,
OL,5,FA US Immigration and Customs
OL,6,FEnforcement (ICE) agent has shot a man
OL,7,Fin his car in the Bronx in New York
OL,8,FCity while the man's five-year-old son
OL,9,Fsat in the backseat.
OL,11,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,12,F(DHS), which runs ICE, confirmed an
OL,13,Fofficer discharged his weapon while
OL,14,Fattempting to arrest a "criminal
OL,15,Fillegal alien" on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe man, later identified as
OL,18,F28-year-old Oscar Belgal, was alive and
OL,19,Fat a local hospital, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
