OL,3,AICE agent shoots man in New York City
OL,4,
OL,5,FNew York Mayor Zohran Mamdani said the
OL,6,FICE officer fired "multiple rounds"
OL,7,Finto the car with a child inside,
OL,8,Fcalling it an "unconscionable and
OL,9,Fincredibly serious situation". The BBC
OL,10,Fhas contacted DHS for comment about
OL,11,FMamdani's remarks.
